🖍️ BLOCK 5 — PHYSICAL RETEST RESULT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- On 2026-09-27 Michael reported that RangeWater 1.2.0 passed all physical tests.
- He specifically reported drawing a pasture, moving corner posts, placing a gate,
  placing and moving water, and positioning the paddock fence multiple times.
- He reported that the corrected reticle "worked exactly fine."
- The correction is therefore physically accepted and this finding no longer blocks
  field acceptance.
- Temporary split-fence placement remains somewhat clunky but usable; this is retained
  as non-blocking follow-up work.
- Yellow and green text on a white/light background can be difficult to read; this is
  retained as non-blocking contrast/accessibility follow-up work.
- Google Play internal migration and production promotion remain separate gates.
- Production promotion remains NOT GRANTED.

